+Root min(norm(h)/R,1), norm(h)<1.01R and near-isotropic threshold are disclosed continuations; equations in the physical ball match the source, while evaluation in the band is the declared Atlas variant. I accept the band diagnostic as implementation evidence, not a physical extension of NH97. Source mR>mT>1 and chi>1 are stricter recommendations than exploratory root bounds. No silent projection/correction or new material law is approved.
