+
+PASS. Both primary sources use tension-positive stress/stretching; NH97p280 explicitly states negative compression. Negating stress, strain and history together preserves eta:D and changes the nonlinear stress tensor sign. The model correctly uses the negative nonlinear vector in compression-positive coordinates. Mandel order xx,yy,zz,xy,yz,xz with sqrt2 physical shear preserves norms and contractions. Sigma is effective Cauchy skeleton stress in Pa; h, e, strain, R, stiffness multipliers and exponents are dimensionless. hs has Pa, phi radians; p_ref scales numerical error and is not a calibrated material stiffness.
